{"1":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O you"},{"c":"الْمُزَّمِّلُ","d":"l-muzamilu","e":"who wraps himself!"}],"a":{"g":"O you who wraps himself [in clothing],"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"قُمِ","d":"qumi","e":"Stand"},{"c":"اللَّيْلَ","d":"al-layla","e":"(in) the night"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"a little"}],"a":{"g":"Arise [to pray] the night, except for a little -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"نِصْفَهُ","d":"niṣ'fahu","e":"Half of it"},{"c":"أَوِ","d":"awi","e":"or"},{"c":"انْقُصْ","d":"unquṣ","e":"lessen"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from it"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"a little"}],"a":{"g":"Half of it - or subtract from it a little"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"Or"},{"c":"زِدْ","d":"zid","e":"add"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِ","d":"ʿalayhi","e":"to it"},{"c":"وَرَتِّلِ","d":"warattili","e":"and recite"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانَ","d":"l-qur'āna","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"تَرْتِيلًا","d":"tartīlan","e":"(with) measured rhythmic recitation"}],"a":{"g":"Or add to it, and recite the Qur'an with measured recitation."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"سَنُلْقِي","d":"sanul'qī","e":"will cast"},{"c":"عَلَيْكَ","d":"ʿalayka","e":"upon you"},{"c":"قَوْلًا","d":"qawlan","e":"a Word"},{"c":"ثَقِيلًا","d":"thaqīlan","e":"heavy"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We will cast upon you a heavy word."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"نَاشِئَةَ","d":"nāshi-ata","e":"(the) rising"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"(at) the night"},{"c":"هِيَ","d":"hiya","e":"it"},{"c":"أَشَدُّ","d":"ashaddu","e":"(is) very hard"},{"c":"وَطْئًا","d":"waṭan","e":"and most potent"},{"c":"وَأَقْوَمُ","d":"wa-aqwamu","e":"and more suitable"},{"c":"قِيلًا","d":"qīlan","e":"(for) Word"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, the hours of the night are more effective for concurrence [of heart and tongue] and more suitable for words."}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"لَكَ","d":"laka","e":"for you"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"النَّهَارِ","d":"l-nahāri","e":"the day"},{"c":"سَبْحًا","d":"sabḥan","e":"(is) occupation"},{"c":"طَوِيلًا","d":"ṭawīlan","e":"prolonged"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, for you by day is prolonged occupation."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"وَاذْكُرِ","d":"wa-udh'kuri","e":"And remember"},{"c":"اسْمَ","d":"is'ma","e":"(the) name"},{"c":"رَبِّكَ","d":"rabbika","e":"(of) your Lord"},{"c":"وَتَبَتَّلْ","d":"watabattal","e":"and devote yourself"},{"c":"إِلَيْهِ","d":"ilayhi","e":"to Him"},{"c":"تَبْتِيلًا","d":"tabtīlan","e":"(with) devotion"}],"a":{"g":"And remember the name of your Lord and devote yourself to Him with [complete] devotion."}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"رَبُّ","d":"rabbu","e":"(The) Lord"},{"c":"الْمَشْرِقِ","d":"l-mashriqi","e":"(of) the east"},{"c":"وَالْمَغْرِبِ","d":"wal-maghribi","e":"and the west;"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(there is) no"},{"c":"إِلَهَ","d":"ilāha","e":"god"},{"c":"إِلَّا","d":"illā","e":"except"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"Him"},{"c":"فَاتَّخِذْهُ","d":"fa-ittakhidh'hu","e":"so take Him"},{"c":"وَكِيلًا","d":"wakīlan","e":"(as) Disposer of Affairs"}],"a":{"g":"[He is] the Lord of the East and the West; there is no deity except Him, so take Him as Disposer of [your] affairs."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَاصْبِرْ","d":"wa-iṣ'bir","e":"And be patient"},{"c":"عَلَى","d":"ʿalā","e":"over"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"يَقُولُونَ","d":"yaqūlūna","e":"they say"},{"c":"وَاهْجُرْهُمْ","d":"wa-uh'jur'hum","e":"and avoid them"},{"c":"هَجْرًا","d":"hajran","e":"an avoidance"},{"c":"جَمِيلًا","d":"jamīlan","e":"gracious"}],"a":{"g":"And be patient over what they say and avoid them with gracious avoidance."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَذَرْنِي","d":"wadharnī","e":"And leave Me"},{"c":"وَالْمُكَذِّبِينَ","d":"wal-mukadhibīna","e":"and the deniers"},{"c":"أُولِي","d":"ulī","e":"possessors"},{"c":"النَّعْمَةِ","d":"l-naʿmati","e":"(of) the ease"},{"c":"وَمَهِّلْهُمْ","d":"wamahhil'hum","e":"and allow them respite"},{"c":"قَلِيلًا","d":"qalīlan","e":"a little"}],"a":{"g":"And leave Me with [the matter of] the deniers, those of ease [in life], and allow them respite a little."}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"لَدَيْنَا","d":"ladaynā","e":"with Us"},{"c":"أَنْكَالًا","d":"ankālan","e":"(are) shackles"},{"c":"وَجَحِيمًا","d":"wajaḥīman","e":"and burning fire"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, with Us [for them] are shackles and burning fire"}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"وَطَعَامًا","d":"waṭaʿāman","e":"And food"},{"c":"ذَا","d":"dhā","e":"that"},{"c":"غُصَّةٍ","d":"ghuṣṣatin","e":"chokes"},{"c":"وَعَذَابًا","d":"waʿadhāban","e":"and a punishment"},{"c":"أَلِيمًا","d":"alīman","e":"painful"}],"a":{"g":"And food that chokes and a painful punishment -"}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"يَوْمَ","d":"yawma","e":"On (the) Day"},{"c":"تَرْجُفُ","d":"tarjufu","e":"will quake"},{"c":"الْأَرْضُ","d":"l-arḍu","e":"the earth"},{"c":"وَالْجِبَالُ","d":"wal-jibālu","e":"and the mountains"},{"c":"وَكَانَتِ","d":"wakānati","e":"and will become"},{"c":"الْجِبَالُ","d":"l-jibālu","e":"the mountains"},{"c":"كَثِيبًا","d":"kathīban","e":"a heap of sand"},{"c":"مَهِيلًا","d":"mahīlan","e":"pouring down"}],"a":{"g":"On the Day the earth and the mountains will convulse and the mountains will become a heap of sand pouring down."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّا","d":"innā","e":"Indeed We"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"[We] have sent"},{"c":"إِلَيْكُمْ","d":"ilaykum","e":"to you"},{"c":"رَسُولًا","d":"rasūlan","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"شَاهِدًا","d":"shāhidan","e":"(as) a witness"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"upon you"},{"c":"كَمَا","d":"kamā","e":"as"},{"c":"أَرْسَلْنَا","d":"arsalnā","e":"We sent"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنَ","d":"fir'ʿawna","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"رَسُولًا","d":"rasūlan","e":"a Messenger"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, We have sent to you a Messenger as a witness upon you just as We sent to Pharaoh a messenger."}},"16":{"w":[{"c":"فَعَصَى","d":"faʿaṣā","e":"But disobeyed"},{"c":"فِرْعَوْنُ","d":"fir'ʿawnu","e":"Firaun"},{"c":"الرَّسُولَ","d":"l-rasūla","e":"the Messenger"},{"c":"فَأَخَذْنَاهُ","d":"fa-akhadhnāhu","e":"so We seized him"},{"c":"أَخْذًا","d":"akhdhan","e":"(with) a seizure"},{"c":"وَبِيلًا","d":"wabīlan","e":"ruinous"}],"a":{"g":"But Pharaoh disobeyed the messenger, so We seized him with a ruinous seizure."}},"17":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَيْفَ","d":"fakayfa","e":"Then how"},{"c":"تَتَّقُونَ","d":"tattaqūna","e":"will you guard yourselves"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كَفَرْتُمْ","d":"kafartum","e":"you disbelieve"},{"c":"يَوْمًا","d":"yawman","e":"a Day"},{"c":"يَجْعَلُ","d":"yajʿalu","e":"(that) will make"},{"c":"الْوِلْدَانَ","d":"l-wil'dāna","e":"the children"},{"c":"شِيبًا","d":"shīban","e":"gray-headed"}],"a":{"g":"Then how can you fear, if you disbelieve, a Day that will make the children white- haired?"}},"18":{"w":[{"c":"السَّمَاءُ","d":"al-samāu","e":"The heaven"},{"c":"مُنْفَطِرٌ","d":"munfaṭirun","e":"(will) break apart"},{"c":"بِهِ","d":"bihi","e":"therefrom"},{"c":"كَانَ","d":"kāna","e":"is"},{"c":"وَعْدُهُ","d":"waʿduhu","e":"His Promise"},{"c":"مَفْعُولًا","d":"mafʿūlan","e":"to be fulfilled"}],"a":{"g":"The heaven will break apart therefrom; ever is His promise fulfilled."}},"19":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"هَذِهِ","d":"hādhihi","e":"this"},{"c":"تَذْكِرَةٌ","d":"tadhkiratun","e":"(is) a Reminder"},{"c":"فَمَنْ","d":"faman","e":"then whoever"},{"c":"شَاءَ","d":"shāa","e":"wills"},{"c":"اتَّخَذَ","d":"ittakhadha","e":"let him take"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"رَبِّهِ","d":"rabbihi","e":"his Lord"},{"c":"سَبِيلًا","d":"sabīlan","e":"a way"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, this is a reminder, so whoever wills may take to his Lord a way."}},"20":{"w":[{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"رَبَّكَ","d":"rabbaka","e":"your Lord"},{"c":"يَعْلَمُ","d":"yaʿlamu","e":"knows"},{"c":"أَنَّكَ","d":"annaka","e":"that you"},{"c":"تَقُومُ","d":"taqūmu","e":"stand"},{"c":"أَدْنَى","d":"adnā","e":"a little less"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"than"},{"c":"ثُلُثَيِ","d":"thuluthayi","e":"two thirds"},{"c":"اللَّيْلِ","d":"al-layli","e":"(of) the night"},{"c":"وَنِصْفَهُ","d":"waniṣ'fahu","e":"and half of it"},{"c":"وَثُلُثَهُ","d":"wathuluthahu","e":"and a third of it"},{"c":"وَطَائِفَةٌ","d":"waṭāifatun","e":"and (so do) a group"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"those who"},{"c":"مَعَكَ","d":"maʿaka","e":"(are) with you"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"يُقَدِّرُ","d":"yuqaddiru","e":"determines"},{"c":"اللَّيْلَ","d":"al-layla","e":"the night"},{"c":"وَالنَّهَارَ","d":"wal-nahāra","e":"and the day"},{"c":"عَلِمَ","d":"ʿalima","e":"He knows"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"لَنْ","d":"lan","e":"not"},{"c":"تُحْصُوهُ","d":"tuḥ'ṣūhu","e":"you count it"},{"c":"فَتَابَ","d":"fatāba","e":"so He has turned"},{"c":"عَلَيْكُمْ","d":"ʿalaykum","e":"to you"},{"c":"فَاقْرَءُوا","d":"fa-iq'raū","e":"so recite"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَيَسَّرَ","d":"tayassara","e":"is easy"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"of"},{"c":"الْقُرْءَانِ","d":"l-qur'āni","e":"the Quran"},{"c":"عَلِمَ","d":"ʿalima","e":"He knows"},{"c":"أَنْ","d":"an","e":"that"},{"c":"سَيَكُونُ","d":"sayakūnu","e":"there will be"},{"c":"مِنْكُمْ","d":"minkum","e":"among you"},{"c":"مَرْضَى","d":"marḍā","e":"sick"},{"c":"وَءَاخَرُونَ","d":"waākharūna","e":"and others"},{"c":"يَضْرِبُونَ","d":"yaḍribūna","e":"traveling"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the land"},{"c":"يَبْتَغُونَ","d":"yabtaghūna","e":"seeking"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"فَضْلِ","d":"faḍli","e":"(the) Bounty"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَءَاخَرُونَ","d":"waākharūna","e":"and others"},{"c":"يُقَاتِلُونَ","d":"yuqātilūna","e":"fighting"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"سَبِيلِ","d":"sabīli","e":"(the) way"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"فَاقْرَءُوا","d":"fa-iq'raū","e":"So recite"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"what"},{"c":"تَيَسَّرَ","d":"tayassara","e":"is easy"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"of it"},{"c":"وَأَقِيمُوا","d":"wa-aqīmū","e":"and establish"},{"c":"الصَّلَوةَ","d":"l-ṣalata","e":"the prayer"},{"c":"وَءَاتُوا","d":"waātū","e":"and give"},{"c":"الزَّكَوةَ","d":"l-zakata","e":"the zakah"},{"c":"وَأَقْرِضُوا","d":"wa-aqriḍū","e":"and loan"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"قَرْضًا","d":"qarḍan","e":"a loan"},{"c":"حَسَنًا","d":"ḥasanan","e":"goodly"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"And whatever"},{"c":"تُقَدِّمُوا","d":"tuqaddimū","e":"you send forth"},{"c":"لِأَنْفُسِكُمْ","d":"li-anfusikum","e":"for yourselves"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"of"},{"c":"خَيْرٍ","d":"khayrin","e":"good"},{"c":"تَجِدُوهُ","d":"tajidūhu","e":"you will find it"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"It"},{"c":"خَيْرًا","d":"khayran","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"وَأَعْظَمَ","d":"wa-aʿẓama","e":"and greater"},{"c":"أَجْرًا","d":"ajran","e":"(in) reward"},{"c":"وَاسْتَغْفِرُوا","d":"wa-is'taghfirū","e":"And seek forgiveness"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"غَفُورٌ","d":"ghafūrun","e":"(is) Oft-Forgiving"},{"c":"رَحِيمٌ","d":"raḥīmun","e":"Most Merciful"}],"a":{"g":"Indeed, your Lord knows, [O Muhammad], that you stand [in prayer] almost two thirds of the night or half of it or a third of it, and [so do] a group of those with you. And Allah determines [the extent of] the night and the day. He has known that you [Muslims] will not be able to do it and has turned to you in forgiveness, so recite what is easy [for you] of the Qur'an. He has known that there will be among you those who are ill and others traveling throughout the land seeking [something] of the bounty of Allah and others fighting for the cause of Allah. So recite what is easy from it and establish prayer and give zakah and loan Allah a goodly loan. And whatever good you put forward for yourselves - you will find it with Allah. It is better and greater in reward. And seek forgiveness of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."}}}